# The approved legal source documents are hash-pinned in
# agreement-source.registry.ts, and every acceptance record seals that hash as
# immutable evidence.
#
# A CRLF checkout changes the bytes without changing a word, which would make
# the tamper guard fire on a clean tree. Pin these to LF everywhere so the
# working copy always matches the form the hashes were computed against.
#
# The loader canonicalises line endings as well — this keeps the file on disk
# honest, that keeps the system correct if anything else ever rewrites it.
*.txt text eol=lf
INGEST_MANIFEST.json text eol=lf
